 kind  of  community and cooperative housing and  also the social housing that gets people  a warm comfortable secure home we live  in a very beautiful place it's very  attractive to people  but we also want them to be vibrant  sustainable communities  full of people who want to live work and  stay here  for those in desperate need of housing  there is no time to waste  the welsh government says it'll  introduce the new measures  this autumn dan white has sky news in  solver  pembrokeshire  you
 

